# Cloudflare Pages SPA routing.
#
# The app is adapter-static with fallback: 'index.html' (svelte.config.js), so
# routing happens entirely in the browser and no path but / exists as a file.
# This serves the shell for every path, with 200 rather than a redirect, and
# lets the client router read the URL it was actually asked for.
#
# It matters more here than in most single-page apps: a board lives at
# /s/<slug>, and that link is the only way a member reaches one. Without this
# a shared link would 404 while the home page worked, which is exactly the
# kind of break that survives testing.
#
# Anything in static/ is copied to the root of the build output.
/*  /index.html  200
